# The Node accept/refuse oracle (tools/check-node-differential.py), pinned.
#
# The image is the one the regular-expression library pins for its ECMAScript
# oracle, by digest, and for the same reason: its V8 and its ICU are known
# (V8 13.6.233.17-node.53, Unicode 17.0, the version this library's data is
# pinned to), a tag can be moved under a name and a digest cannot, and V8's
# regular-expression interpreter and compiler agree in this version, which
# --regexp-interpret-all keeps true whatever later V8 replaces it. A newer pin
# needs a written reason and its own commit and triage: a newer V8 ships more
# of the 17th edition and answers some rows of tests/data-node-differences.tsv
# differently.
#
# --experimental-vm-modules makes vm.SourceTextModule, which parses a module
# without linking or running it, available. --no-warnings keeps its
# experimental-feature warning off standard error, where the first line is the
# version the gate checks.
image=docker.io/library/node:24-slim@sha256:0e0ff40c39bc087845bfb27465a0df4ea419520094bc35842ff83dd8cbe6f9b6
node=v24.21.0
v8=13.6.233.17-node.53
unicode=17.0
flags=--regexp-interpret-all --experimental-vm-modules --no-warnings
